  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Perception 5 ranks, Telekinesis sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can use your telekinesis to sense your surroundings, passively measuring vibrations in the ground. You gain tremorsense with a 15 feet range.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> If you possess the Kinetic Sense talent, add 15 feet to the range of the tremorsense it provides.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/protokinesis-feats#toc16\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
